Z||000001||StuGood||10-03-2000||01:13 PM||||Lope? Nope.  At least I don't think so... the stock Fiero 2.8 has what I'd call a nice "burble" sound.<P>High idle can be a vacuum leak, or ECM needs to be trained, by driving around at moderate, varying speeds for several minutes.  Mine idle nicely at about 900 rpm.     ||||reg||5
